OL,3,ANorway mourns King Harald as Haakon
OL,4,AVIII ascends throne
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarald - who was on the throne for 35
OL,7,Fyears - died in hospital at 06:35 local
OL,8,Ftime (04:35 GMT) aged 89, after being
OL,9,Ftreated there for a rare blood
OL,10,Fcondition. His coffin was later taken
OL,11,Fto the palace in a public procession.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
